  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>System of questions</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p>Now finding,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;the system of equations will have infinite solutions,</p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;the system&nbsp;has infinite solution,</p><p>And when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;the system has no solution as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>2</mn></math>,</p><p>Hence, only option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is not correct</p>",
